## .NET build output
bin/
obj/
publish/
publish-sc/

## Visual Studio / Rider
.vs/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo

## OS junk
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini

## Sensitive local files (never commit; commit *.example templates instead)
## Extension-scoped so source files like credentials.rs / credentials.h stay trackable
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.key
*.pem
*credentials*.json
*credentials*.toml

## Local tools / intermediates
kimi logo.webp
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# ZCode agent's local ignore config — never commit, never pack into release zips
.zcodeignore

## Release artifacts (built locally, uploaded to GitHub Releases)
## `.zip*` / `SHA256SUMS.txt*` also cover the `.part` intermediates written before
## the atomic renames; the `.exe` names are the GitHub asset names, droppable at
## the repo root so that `sha256sum -c SHA256SUMS.txt` works in place
## (make_release_zip.py excludes the same names from the source snapshot).
KimiPlanbarTray-*.zip*
KimiPlanbarTray-*.exe
SHA256SUMS.txt*
